      "writtenOn": "2021-01-04T17:43:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Todd, \n\nI would like to understand the guidelines for the debug_module. Here is my understanding --\n1) Functions need to use the EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL for vendor module usage. \n2) Global symbols can be exported with EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL.\n3) Global symbols which cannot be exported with EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL, will be maintained with debug_symbol driver.\n\nIs my understanding correct?\n\nEXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL can be used for global symbols and are there any need to consolidate all the symbols to debug_symbols drivers?  Please provide disadvantages with current approach. \n\n\n-Thanks, Prasad",
      "parentUuid": "1536eeb1_3e5a0f25",
      "revId": "c565d7f254deceae313c12a64b2d674f99004647",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
